	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Septimanis iam aliquot rariores ad te, mi <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>frater, literas dedi non aliam ob causam, quam quod <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>non ignorem symmystas nunc quoque suas ad te mittere, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ex quibus ea intelligere potes, quae tua scire <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>interest et quae ex meis poteras discere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vero, cum statuerim 4. iunii deo favente hinc <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>abire ad balnea <placeName>Vulturena</placeName> sanitatis meae et re<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>parandae et confirmandae gratia, ita enim cogor urgentibus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>me aliquot meis infirmitatibus magnisque <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>doloribus torquentibus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dabit forte dominus meliora, aut <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>si deteriora dederit, voluntarium et promptissimum eius <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>me gratia prosequente praestabo.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Vixi iam 67 annos <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>per dei gratiam; si quid meis annis addere voluerit, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>faciat, quod bonum est in oculis eius; ego me ipsi totum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>committo obsecrans, ut sua prosequatur in finem usque <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>gratia.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ergo, si quid vel tu vel alii scribere volueritis, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>literas ad generum meum d. <persName ref="p8442">Simlerum</persName> vel <persName ref="p1884">Lavaterum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mittite; illi probe curabunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Interim precor, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ut futura vestra synodus feliciter peragatur et terminetur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Cave in ea, ne sinas te pertrahi in disputationes <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>eorum articulorum, qui confessi et plani <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sunt, quales sunt articuli de trinitate, de divinitate <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>et similibus Iesu Christi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Indignum est, ut ponamus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>in dubium, quae sunt compertissima.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Magnus ille <persName ref="p18541">Con<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>stantinus</persName> indignissime ferebat, ut eius adhuc epistolae apud <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Eusebium testantur, quod <persName ref="p19917">Alexander</persName> et <persName ref="p18820">Arius</persName> in hanc des<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>cendissent arenam et articulos fidei contentionibus <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>inseruissent.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sed dabit dominus invocantibus se in ver<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>itate, quod fuerit e gloria eius et salute eius ecclesiae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Superioribus literis significavi tibi principes <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>evangelicos synodum conscripsisse omnibus per uni<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>versam <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> evangelicis ministris <placeName ref="l272">Rupellam</placeName> et eo profectum <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>et <persName ref="p8033">Bezam</persName> nostrum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Rediit is superioribus diebus, deo <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>gratia, salvus et incolumis et scribit ad nos statum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>fidelium in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> tolerabilem et bonae spei esse; <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>regem serio pacem tueri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Synodum convenisse <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ex omnibus <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName> provinciis; amice contulisse et <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>summa cum charitate et concordia discessum esse.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Con<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>senserunt omnes in confessionem olim regi oblatam <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>et literis communibus ex synodo scriptis ad nos <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>testantur se consentire nobiscum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Pietatis, amoris <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et eruditionis plenae sunt illae literae.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Forte dabitur <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>aliquando, ut copiam earum a me accipias.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Subscripserunt <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>manibus propriis singularum provinciarum <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ministri praecipui ex <placeName ref="l301">Lugduno</placeName>, <placeName ref="l631">Burgundia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName>Oxitana</placeName>, <placeName ref="l2576">Avernia</placeName>, ex provincia <placeName>Bituricensi</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName>Engelisenensi</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1867">Pictavorum</placeName>, ex <placeName ref="l2705">Aquitania</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>vel <placeName>Wasconia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l2770">Normandia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l2589">Picardia</placeName>, <placeName>Francia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><placeName ref="l630">Britannia</placeName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Interfuerunt synodo principes <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>evangelici.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Breviter: summa fuit inter omnes <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>concordia, quae res sane admiranda videtur <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>merito, quod post tot caedes, clades et calamitates <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>inventi sunt adhuc tot pastores et tot <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>celebrium ecclesiarum et tam probe consentientes <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>et prompti ad propagandum Christi evangelium.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Audio consensum illum in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> magni fieri a <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>pluribus et adversarios terrere.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Laudandus <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>est itaque dominus et orandus, ut progressum praestet <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>optimis his rebus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Neroberga haec septimana literas accepi significantes <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>captivum Saxonem <persName ref="p20484">Ioannem Fredericum</persName> incitante <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>imperatore scripsisse ad fratrem <persName>Ioannem Wilhelmum</persName>, Flaccianos <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>e regione sua eiiciat, utpote homines turbulentos <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>et seditiosos; sapiat tandem fratris captivi e<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>xemplo; - item <placeName ref="l2510">Turcarum</placeName> imperatorem cu<lb xml:id="p2z28"/>m <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>Tartaris expeditionem facere maximam in <placeName ref="l869">Trans<lb xml:id="p2z30"/>sylvaniam</placeName>, cuius princeps Weywoda martii 17. <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>mortuus est; imperatorem vero Romanum indicturum comitia <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>vel <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonam</placeName> vel <placeName ref="l18">Augustam Vindelicorum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Er <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>wird filicht abermals mit sinem frowenzim<lb xml:id="p2z34"/>mer an den <placeName ref="l2510">Türggen</placeName> ziehen etc.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Dominus misereatur no<lb xml:id="p2z35"/>stri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Optime vale cum d. d. consulibus, d. <persName ref="p18489">Gregorio</persName>, <persName ref="p8057">Cam[pello]</persName><note type="margin">a.R. von Egli beigefügt: "Camp."</note>, <lb xml:id="p2z36"/><persName ref="p6130">Pontisella</persName>, <persName ref="p8186">Boneto</persName>, omnibus notis et amicis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z37"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 25. maii, quo die in <placeName ref="l632">Alsatia</placeName> propter pluviosum <lb xml:id="p2z38"/>coelum Urbanus parum urbane per omnes raptatur lacunas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Zu den Bräuchen am Urbanstag s. Handwörterbuch des dt. Aberglaubens VIII 1497f.</note>, <lb xml:id="p2z39"/>1571.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z40"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8016">Tobiae <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Eglio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>ecclesiae ministro fideli, <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>domino meo honorando <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>et fratri dilecto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z6"/>Zuͦ <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p4z7"/>dem p[far]rer zuͦ S.[Marti]<lb xml:id="p4z8"/>n.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
